---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Admin
    participant Page as Admin page
    participant Api as Export routes (proposed)<br/>/api/export<br/>/api/export/status/[jobId]
    participant Job as Background job<br/>zip export
    participant DB as Supabase DB
    participant S3 as AWS S3

    Note over Admin,S3: Covers US 3.0.3. All steps are proposed. The flow copies<br/>the PDF job pattern (S26_pdf_jobs, after(), presigned URL).<br/>W26_export_jobs is like S26_pdf_jobs, without mode and request_payload.

    Admin->>Page: Select Export all files
    Page->>Api: POST /api/export: createExportJob()
    Api->>Api: Check caller is Admin<br/>from a trusted role source, store not decided
    alt Caller is not Admin
        Api-->>Page: 403. No job is made
        Page-->>Admin: Show "not allowed"
    else Caller is Admin
        Api->>DB: Insert W26_export_jobs row,<br/>status pending, created_by = caller
        Api-->>Page: 202 with jobId
        Api->>Job: after(): run zip job
        Job->>DB: Read storage keys from W26_attachments,<br/>W26_homepage-image-uploads, W26_gpx_tracks<br/>and completed S26_pdf_jobs
        DB-->>Job: Storage keys
        loop Each stored file
            Job->>S3: Get file
            S3-->>Job: File
            Job->>Job: Add file to zip
        end
        alt A file is missing or the job fails
            Job->>DB: Update W26_export_jobs row: status failed,<br/>error with file names
        else Zip is made (AT 1, AT 2)
            Job->>S3: Put zip file
            Job->>DB: Update W26_export_jobs row: status complete,<br/>storage_path of the zip
        end
        Page->>Api: GET /api/export/status/[jobId]:<br/>getExportJobStatus(jobId)
        Api->>Api: Check session. Check caller is Admin or job creator
        alt Caller is not Admin and not the job creator
            Api-->>Page: 403. No status and no URL
        else Caller is allowed
            Api->>DB: Read W26_export_jobs row
            DB-->>Api: status, error, storage_path
            alt Status is failed
                Api-->>Page: Failed with error
                Page-->>Admin: Show Failed with reason
            else Status is pending or processing
                Api-->>Page: Not ready
                Page-->>Admin: Show progress and ask again later
            else Status is complete
                Api-->>Page: Presigned download URL
                Page-->>Admin: Download ZIP with all images, GPX files and completed PDFs
            end
        end
    end

    Note over Job,S3: Zip size and job run time can be large.<br/>The limits are an open question for the team.
